<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="mn">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Хайрган Хана Байшин — FORAE ARCHITECTS</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --paper: #ffffff; --ink: #161616; --graphite: #7a7a75; --hairline: #e6e5e0;
    --sans: "Inter", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { 
    background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--sans); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 100vh;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  main { flex: 1 0 auto; width: 100%; padding: 48px 32px 0; }
  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  
  /* Header */
  .header-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 20px 32px; gap: 24px; }
  .logo { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.02em; text-transform: lowercase; }
  nav.primary { display: flex; gap: 32px; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; font-weight: 400; text-transform: lowercase; }
  nav.primary a:hover { color: var(--graphite); }

  /* Content */
  .project-container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .project-header { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 48px; }
  .project-title { font-weight: 500; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; margin-bottom: 16px; display: block; }
  .meta-line { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 400; }
  .meta-label { color: var(--graphite); }
  .project-image-wrap { width: 100%; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .project-image-wrap img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
  .project-description { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink); max-width: 900px; text-align: justify; }

  /* Footer */
  footer { margin-top: auto; padding: 24px 32px 32px; text-align: center; }
  .copyright { font-size: 12px; color: var(--graphite); }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .header-inner { padding: 14px 18px; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; }
    nav.primary { gap: 16px; }
    main { padding: 24px 18px 0; }
    .project-header { font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .project-description { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="header-inner">
    <a class="logo" href="/">forae architects</a>
    <nav class="primary">
      <a href="/practice">practice</a>
      <a href="/contact">contact</a>
      <a href="/news">news</a>
      <a href="/reference">reference</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <div class="project-container">
    <div class="project-header">
      <span class="project-title">Хайрган Хана Байшин atelier house, yangpyong</span>
      <div class="meta-line"><span class="meta-label">location :</span> Төв аймаг, Монгол Улс</div>
      <div class="meta-line"><span class="meta-label">year :</span> 2026, 01 - барилгын ажил үргэлжилж байна</div>
    </div>
    <div class="project-image-wrap">
      <img src="/project1.jpg" alt="Atelier House Architecture Model">
    </div>
    <div class="project-description">
      Байгалийн тогтоцтой уусгаж, хамгийн бага зардлаар бүтээлч орон зайг бий болгох зорилготой амины орон сууцны төсөл.
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<footer>
  <p class="copyright">© 2026 forae architects</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
